# Tabby: only the portable profile is tracked
tabby/*
!tabby/config.yaml

# Local editor/terminal state and backups
*.bak
*.backup
*.bak-*

# This repo is public, and a real manifest lists what is installed, what launches at login and
# where the user folders live. Only machine.example.json, the shape, is tracked.
machine/machine.json

# Per-machine notes, same reasoning. Ignored as a class so a new one cannot be added by accident.
*.local.md

# Agent working state. Also covered by the deployed global ignore, repeated here so the repo
# does not depend on the shell layer having been deployed first.
.claude/
